{{For|the Phantom Spirit on public islands|Phantom Spirit}}
The '''Phantom Spirit''' is a mob that spawns during [[Spooky Festival]]s at night. 

== Spawning ==
'''Phantom Spirits''' can spawn on the {{Zone|Private Island}} in dark areas at night during a [[Spooky Festival]].

